<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Bieckert resumes trading.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Bieckert resumes trading.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Buenos Aires bolsa said trading had resumed in shares of Cerveceria Bieckert.</p>
<p>Trading in the brewer's stock was suspended earlier Monday because of talks to sell a 85 percent stake in the company to Argentina's Quilmes Industrial.</p>
